  "platform": "combined",
  "description": "One report from X, Facebook and Instagram links together, on clean landscape 16:9 pages: cover, summary table of sections, then one page per post — platform logo, handle, date, Post i of N, metric pills that appear only for the metrics your sheet has (Like, Impressions, Views, Reach, Comments, Shares), an Open post button, and the screenshot filling its box. Nothing is baked into the page art, so every value is real. Give it your own background from the project's Styles page.",
